er. Upgrade your character and tools, and learn more about the spooky history of the manor that you're trapped beneath, and those who once lived there\u2026 and those who might still be there\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op craziness:</strong> Play solo or with up to 4 players in drop-in/drop-out online co-op. Proximity voice chat keeps things immersive... or hilariously loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366370/extras/7e5866068c70fce9c5a3bece0b7cf47d.poster.avif?t=1749087271\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366370/extras/7e5866068c70fce9c5a3bece0b7cf47d.webm?t=1749087271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366370/extras/7e5866068c70fce9c5a3bece0b7cf47d.mp4?t=1749087271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fearful consequences:</strong> Spooky events will raise your fear gauge - keep it under control or run the risk of triggering strange hallucinations, or even worse - spawning the creatures you thought you had forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat quests:</strong>\u00a0Meet McClane, a thousand year old spirit cat who was there at the start of all this mess. Perform unusual tasks for this cantankerous cat, and he\u2019ll help you uncover the deepest secrets of the bunker.</p>",
